  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Conversion of semi-detached dwelling into two separate dwellings (1 X 2 bed and 1 X 4 bed);  Parking;  cycle and bin storage; subdivision of amenity space",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of the insertion of a second front door tucked behind the existing front porch, the absence of meaningful soft landscaping, and the constrained outlook from Bedroom 3 of Unit No. 20 obstructed by the existing first-floor extension, would result in a poorly legible residential layout, substandard level of internal amenity for future occupiers and would harm the amenity of the streetscape. The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), Harrow Core Strategy Policy CS1 (2012), Policies DM1, DM22, DM23, DM26 and DM27 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), and the London Borough of Harrow’s Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document (2010)."
  ],
